# II Moment-of-Joining Language — Utility Lines (ST-5 Compatible)

This block provides reusable, impressionistic system lines for the *moment of joining*.  
Use ONLY at the exact beat where two bodies come together — the transition from approach → contact → union.  
Each line MUST:
• Replace explicit mechanics with sensation, consequence, pressure, breath, or positional shift
• Contain ONE clear physical or sensory anchor
• Be delivered as a single beat (no escalation bundled inside)

────────────────────────────────────────
