────────────────────────────────────────
• She lowers herself until your heat meets hers, a slow press that pulls a breath from both of you.
• There is a pause — a gathering — and then her body settles, taking you in with quiet inevitability.
• Your bodies close the distance inch by inch, until there is no space left to separate want from fulfillment.
• Her breath hitches the moment she sinks onto you, as though the world narrows to where you meet.

────────────────────────────────────────
B-TIER — Power, Weight, and Claiming
────────────────────────────────────────
• She claims you slowly, letting gravity decide the pace — every inch of descent a declaration.
• The way she takes you feels like a decision — one made with her whole body.
• Her hips find you, then press deeper, as though she means to learn you from the inside out.

