────────────────────────────────────────
• Heat wraps around you, a sudden rush that steals your breath before you can prepare.
• The first moment of joining is almost too much — tight, consuming, a pulse that welcomes and demands.
• It feels like being drawn into her, pulled rather than pushed — as though she is the one doing the taking.

